flide/kernels/fla holds the forward Gated DeltaNet kernels of flash-linear-attention 0.6.0
(https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention), copied with their wrappers and trimmed to the forward
path (the chunked gated delta rule, its causal convolution, L2 norm, beta sigmoid and gate), and
flide/kernels/gdn.py contains a Triton kernel derived from two of them:
chunk_gated_delta_rule_fwd_kernel_h_blockdim64 and chunk_fwd_kernel_o. They are used under the MIT License:

